  "description": "<p>Exporting using a Bag config that doesn't include APTrust info throws an error:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/67#issuecomment-267594588\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/67#issuecomment-267594588</a></p>\n\n<p>When using a non-APTrust profile, those fields will not be provided.  Even when using the APTrust profile, not specifying the APTrust fields should result in a clear error message, not a parsing error.</p>",
